(11424: (meta: (t: semantic) (n: 1) (term: string%20value) (def: %2F%2F%21%20Translates%20meta-language%27s%20own%20modules%20between%20JavaScript%2C%20TypeScript%20and%0A%2F%2F%21%20Rust%20through%20meta-language%20links.%0A%2F%2F%21%0A%2F%2F%21%20The%20source%20is%20parsed%20losslessly%20with%20its%20default%20grammar%3B%20a%20translation%0A%2F%2F%21%20into%20the%20same%20language%20writes%20the%20links%20back%20byte%20for%20byte%2C%20and%20a%0A%2F%2F%21%20translation%20into%20the%20other%20language%20translates%20each%20top-level%20item%20the%0A%2F%2F%21%20portable%20core%20can%20express%20and%20carries%20every%20other%20item%20verbatim%20in%20a%0A%2F%2F%21%20marked%20comment.%20Both%20kinds%20of%20item%20keep%20their%20source%20as%20provenance%2C%20so%0A%2F%2F%21%20translating%20an%20unedited%20translation%20back%20restores%20the%20source%20byte%20for%0A%2F%2F%21%20byte.%0A%2F%2F%21%0A%2F%2F%21%20Mirrors%20%60js%2Fsrc%2Fself-translation.js%60.%0A%0Ause%20crate%3A%3Atranslation%3A%3Afrontend_rules%3A%3A%7B%0A%20%20%20%20accept_source_envelope_restoration%2C%20accept_source_prefix_restoration%2C%0A%7D%3B%0Ause%20crate%3A%3Atranslation%3A%3Asurface%3A%3ASExpr%3B%0Ause%20std%3A%3Acollections%3A%3ABTreeMap%3B%0Ause%20std%3A%3Acollections%3A%3A%7BHashMap%2C%20HashSet%7D%3B%0Ause%20std%3A%3Afmt%3B%0Ause%20std%3A%3Afmt%3A%3AWrite%20as%20_%3B%0Ause%20std%3A%3Async%3A%3ALazyLock%3B%0A%0Ause%20regex%3A%3ARegex%3B%0Ause%20sha2%3A%3A%7BDigest%2C%20Sha256%7D%3B%0A%0Ause%20crate%3A%3Adecorators%3A%3ADecoratorSet%3B%0Ause%20crate%3A%3Agrammar%3A%3Adecorate_emitted%3B%0Ause%20crate%3A%3Atranslation%3A%3Asurface%3A%3AExternal%3B%0Ause%20crate%3A%3A%7BLinkNetwork%2C%20ParseConfiguration%7D%3B%0A%0Amod%20binding%3B%0Amod%20emission%3B%0Apub%20mod%20representation%3B%0Amod%20representation_rules%3B%0Ause%20emission%3A%3Aemit_item%3B%0Ause%20representation%3A%3AContext%3B%0Amod%20scope%3B%0Amod%20typescript_erasure%3B%0Amod%20typescript_erasure_rules%3B%0Amod%20typescript_portable_ty